{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/7c2c3fd6db7abf9b1a35eaf2d2151084.poster.avif?t=1771336654\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/7c2c3fd6db7abf9b1a35eaf2d2151084.webm?t=1771336654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Mr Toilet</strong> you\u2019re more than just a janitor. You\u2019re the <i>lord and master</i> of the public restroom. Who leaves with a smile, and who gets kicked out? That\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/997b9d22035fa7a8d2efc24abd2d378f.avif?t=1771336654\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/06c1e843e2348f2108eafaed2fda5877.poster.avif?t=1771336654\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/06c1e843e2348f2108eafaed2fda5877.webm?t=1771336654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Set your entrance fees: squeeze every last coin from your customers or win them over with free entry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/6ffdeab52fcf8b654f540aac72b55c81.poster.avif?t=1771336654\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/6ffdeab52fcf8b654f540aac72b55c81.webm?t=1771336654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Confront a smartass who skipped payment and politely ask... or use stronger arguments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/074ef4fced8027ba8deed654a590c2b8.poster.avif?t=1771336654\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/074ef4fced8027ba8deed654a590c2b8.webm?t=1771336654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Shiny or filthy? The choice is yours. Just don\u2019t forget about your reputation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/1cac087d9f87851e58f20ac977d72117.poster.avif?t=1771336654\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/1cac087d9f87851e58f20ac977d72117.webm?t=1771336654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Invest in automation, special items, and decorations to attract customers (and bigger tips).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/0570c30544a053d881b6bd1c267d0f34.poster.avif?t=1771336654\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/0570c30544a053d881b6bd1c267d0f34.webm?t=1771336654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keep track of your supplies: soap, paper, towels. It\u2019s up to you whether customers get comfort... or trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Here\u2019s what awaits you:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your own restroom and turn it into a truly royal facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade, decorate, automate, and profit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep things tidy and stocked \u2013 don\u2019t let customers run out of toilet paper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enforce the rules: make sure everyone pays, nobody trashes the place, and no smoking in the stalls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh yourself silly with a ton of absurdity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mr Toilet</strong> is not just about cleaning. It\u2019s a game of power in a place where no one wants to rule\u2026</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930150?t=1771336654","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/0eab5bed199bc93f9e1e7a13101e4e473e157bf9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771336654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/b05506c48e2015707953d602bd40cce08689f6a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771336654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/b05506c48e2015707953d602bd40cce08689f6a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771336654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4334880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/7c2c3fd6db7abf9b1a35eaf2d2151084.poster.avif?t=1771336654\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/7c2c3fd6db7abf9b1a35eaf2d2151084.webm?t=1771336654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Mr Toilet</strong> you\u2019re more than just a janitor. You\u2019re the <i>lord and master</i> of the public restroom. Who leaves with a smile, and who gets kicked out? That\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930150/extras/997b9d22035fa7a8d2efc24abd2d378f.avif?t=1771336654\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat